                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Key given from developer for review purposes.\n\nWell this game sure is something...\nDon't get me wrong this game is still in earlt access and I have some hope for it but in this stage it's barely playable...\nPros: ...\n-car models\n-interesting physics (for having fun, not intended)\n-good idea\n-nice weapons\n\nCons:\n-repetitive music\n-unbeatable AI\n-no story\n-bad controls (pointless use of mouse)\n-zombies can only be run over (tested every weapon)\n-crashing in enemies only damages you\n-no servers/players\n-soooo many bugs\n-gameplay gets repetitive pretty fast\n\nRight now it's 2/10 but keep track of this one cuz it has lots of potential and I belive it can be turned in really good expirience.",
